codex
The public package confirms the phase shape: width 256, depth 32, budget `2.72e11`, He weights. That means full covariance is too expensive per layer, so the likely wins are better probe designs and using the free 10% budget floor more accurately.
codex
Before spending another multi-minute blackbox run, I’ll do cheap synthetic experiments on randomly generated MLPs to rank candidate changes. These won’t use hidden evaluation data; they’re just matching the published generative model.
